        "id": "YasuoPassive",
        "name": "Way of the Wanderer",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Yasuo's Critical Strike Chance is increased. Additionally, Yasuo builds toward a shield whenever he is moving. The shield triggers when he takes damage from a champion or monster.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Way of the Wanderer</span><span><font color='#FF9900' size='18'>Resolve:</span> Moving grants Flow, which is tracked on Yasuo's resource bar. Moving faster grants more Flow. At maximum Flow, damage from a champion or monster briefly grants a shield that absorbs ? Damage (scaling by level).<br /><br /><font color='#FF9900' size='18'>Intent:</span> Yasuo's Critical Strike Chance is increased by 150%, but his Critical Strikes deal 15% reduced Damage. Current bonus: ?%.</span>",
