        "name": "Sweeping Blade",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Dashes through target enemy, dealing magic damage. Each cast increases subsequent dash's damage, up to a max amount.<br><br>Cannot be re-cast on the same enemy for a few seconds.<br><br><font color='#99FF99'>If Steel Tempest is cast while dashing, it will strike as a circle.</font>",
        "bodyHtml": "Yasuo dashes through a target, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/85/100/115/130 + ([[si:scalead]]20% bonus Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Each use of this Ability grants <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(17.5/21.25/25/28.75/32.5 + (5% bonus Attack Damage) + (15% Ability Power))</span> bonus damage to subsequent uses for 5 seconds, stacking up to 4 times.<br /><br />This Ability has a 10/9/8/7/6 second per-target Cooldown.",
